  "description": "Provides enhanced translation tools, so you can extract, send and manage your translations from within Umbraco. Includes Google, DeepL, Microsoft, XLIFF and AI connectors. To translate through your Umbraco.AI profiles instead, add the Umbraco.AI connector (Jumoo.TranslationManager.UmbracoAi).",
